WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:17.694
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

2
00:00:17.695 --> 00:00:19.614
Riley: What is it, Snooks?

3
00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:23.110
It's The Dog Tooth Fairy!

4
00:00:23.111 --> 00:00:27.771
Riley: Let's see if she came back!

5
00:00:27.772 --> 00:00:34.178
Riley: Mom, look. There's an envelope on Snooks' pillow.

6
00:00:34.179 --> 00:00:36.691
Mrs. Summers: What's inside?

7
00:00:36.692 --> 00:00:43.069
Riley: Sarah's tooth. And a note!

8
00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:46.970
Riley: "Dear Sarah, Here is your tooth.

9
00:00:46.971 --> 00:00:51.652
Good luck! The Dog Tooth Fairy."

10
00:00:51.653 --> 00:00:54.310
Mrs. Summers: Sarah will be very glad!

11
00:00:54.311 --> 00:01:01.857
Riley: I'll get dressed and go tell her!

12
00:01:01.858 --> 00:01:05.203
Sarah: I'm so happy I got my tooth back.

13
00:01:05.204 --> 00:01:08.286
The Dog Tooth Fairy is very nice.

14
00:01:08.287 --> 00:01:11.675
Riley: I wonder if she looks like Snooks.

15
00:01:11.676 --> 00:01:18.174
Skyler: Ha-ha! Snooks with fairy wings!

16
00:01:18.175 --> 00:01:21.220
Theo: What's wrong, Ben?

17
00:01:21.221 --> 00:01:23.987
Ben: I'm happy Sarah got her tooth back.

18
00:01:23.988 --> 00:01:27.801
I just wish I had a loose tooth.

19
00:01:27.802 --> 00:01:30.462
Skyler: Remember what Riley's mom said?

20
00:01:30.463 --> 00:01:39.417
Kids: Everything will happen at the right time!

21
00:01:39.418 --> 00:01:42.586
Skyler: Thank you for the ice cream, Mrs. Summers.

22
00:01:42.587 --> 00:01:45.623
Sarah: I got Cherry Cheesecake.

23
00:01:45.624 --> 00:01:50.394
Theo: Mine is Cotton Candy. My favorite!

24
00:01:50.395 --> 00:01:54.610
Ben: I got Chewy Chocolate Fudge.

25
00:01:54.611 --> 00:01:58.175
Riley: This ice cream is the best!

26
00:01:58.176 --> 00:02:03.836
Ben: This chewy fudge is very sticky.

27
00:02:03.837 --> 00:02:08.365
Chatter: Very sticky! Ha-ha!

28
00:02:08.366 --> 00:02:18.067
Riley: No, Snooks. Ice cream is not good for dogs.

29
00:02:18.068 --> 00:02:19.899
Ben: Oh my gosh!

30
00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.155
Theo: What happened!

31
00:02:22.156 --> 00:02:30.136
Ben: My tooth! The chewy fudge pulled it right out!

32
00:02:30.137 --> 00:02:34.511
Riley: The tooth fairy will be very busy tonight.

33
00:02:34.512 --> 00:02:37.185
Ben: She has to visit Sarah and me.

34
00:02:37.186 --> 00:02:39.466
I hope she can do it!

35
00:02:39.467 --> 00:02:48.406
Mrs. Summers: Don't worry. Everything will happen at the right time!
